# Cloudflare Pages custom headers.
#
# The policy below: the app loads one bundle from its own origin and talks to a
# short, known list of read-only APIs. Pinning both means a script injected by
# any means has nowhere to load from and nowhere to send to.
#
#   script-src 'self'      the build emits one external module, no inline
#                          script, no eval, no WebAssembly (verified against
#                          dist/ before shipping)
#              cloudflareinsights  Cloudflare injects its Web Analytics beacon
#                          into every HTML response at the edge, so the policy
#                          has to admit it (script origin) and its RUM endpoint
#                          (connect origin), or every page load logs a blocked
#                          script and the project loses its analytics
#   style-src  'unsafe-inline'  React style attributes (validator accent
#                          colours, chart geometry) are inline styles
#   connect-src            every origin the app actually calls:
#                            rpc.nimiqwatch.com          balances, history, staker records
#                            v2.nimiqwatch.com           staking reward events
#                            api.coingecko.com           fiat rates and daily closes
#                            validators-api-main…        validator list, fees, reliability
#                            the five EVM public RPCs viem defaults to
#                          plus 'self' for /api/shorten and /export
#   frame-src              the Nimiq Hub opens an iframe for its desktop login
#   img-src data:          validator logos ride along as data: URIs
#
# Deliberately NO frame-ancestors: Nimiq Pay's WebView frames this app, and
# restricting ancestors would break the mini app it ships as.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com https://rpc.nimiqwatch.com https://v2.nimiqwatch.com https://api.coingecko.com https://validators-api-main.je-cf9.workers.dev https://polygon.drpc.org https://mainnet.base.org https://arb1.arbitrum.io https://mainnet.optimism.io https://ethereum.reth.rs; frame-src https://hub.nimiq.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
